SUMMARY:Summer Sessions at Paradise Ridge
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy sweeping westerly views of rolling hills and vineyards at Paradise Ridge Winery during Sunday Live Music Sessions. Held on the 1st and 3rd Sundays from May 3–May 17\, 1–4 PM\, this relaxed series features live acoustic and popular tunes in a warm\, scenic wine country setting.    Guests can unwind with artisan cheeses\, cured meats\, olives\, hand pies\, and other light fare while enjoying the music and vineyard ambiance. The May 3 session features the Alt City Band.    It’s a laid-back way to spend a Sunday afternoon in Paradise.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/summer-sessions-at-paradise-ridge/
