SUMMARY:Happy Hour at Russian River Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Starting May 7 through October 29\, enjoy Thursday evenings from 5 PM – 7:30 PM at Russian River Vineyards. Unwind with special pricing on wines by the glass\, local craft beers\, and a menu of freshly prepared small bites and appetizers.    Set in a relaxed wine country atmosphere\, this weekly gathering is perfect for connecting with friends\, savoring great flavors\, and easing into the evening. Don’t miss this seasonal tradition of good drinks\, delicious food\, and laid-back fun.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/happy-hour-at-russian-river-vineyards/
LOCATION:5700 Gravenstein Highway North, Forestville, CA, 95436, United States
