SUMMARY:Eco-Friendly Garden Tour in Sonoma
DESCRIPTION:The Eco-Friendly Garden Tour is a public outreach program that promotes sustainable landscaping by showcasing inspiring gardens across Sonoma and Marin counties. Highlighting Russian River-Friendly and Bay-Friendly practices\, the tour features water-wise design\, native plants\, and environmentally responsible techniques.    Guests can explore gardens created by Qualified Water Efficient Landscaper–certified professionals\, including both personal and client spaces that demonstrate real-world applications of sustainable gardening.    This self-guided experience allows visitors to choose which gardens to visit and explore at their own pace\, creating a personalized journey through some of the region’s most beautiful and eco-conscious landscapes.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/eco-friendly-garden-tour-in-sonoma/
LOCATION:783 Broadway, Sonoma, CA, 95476, United States
GEO:-122.459041;38.286879
CATEGORIES:Educational,Family Friendly,Outdoors,Sonoma County
