SUMMARY:Making Lip Balm and Body Scrub at Gold Ridge
DESCRIPTION:DIY Lip Balm &amp; Body Scrub Workshop at Gold Ridge Organic Farms invites guests to enjoy a hands-on experience in the charming Apple Cottage. Participants will learn to craft their own lip balm and body scrub using organic olive oil while exploring essential oils to create personalized\, natural products.    Guided by aromatherapist Anna O’Neil\, this relaxed and creative workshop blends wellness and artistry in a beautiful farm setting. The experience includes a scenic trolley ride through the orchards\, morning tea\, and all materials needed to create two lip balms and a custom body scrub to take home.    Perfect for a unique outing or a meaningful Mother’s Day activity\, this experience offers a memorable way to connect\, create\, and enjoy the beauty of Gold Ridge Organic Farms.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/making-lip-balm-and-body-scrub-at-gold-ridge/
LOCATION:3387 Canfield Road, Sebastopol, CA, 95472, United States
CATEGORIES:Educational,Holiday,Sonoma County
