SUMMARY:The Sparkling Soirée at Gloria Ferrer Winery
DESCRIPTION:The Sparkling Soirée: A Mother’s Day Paint Experience invites guests to celebrate Mother’s Day weekend with an elegant afternoon at Willow Springs\, set among scenic vineyards.    Guests will enjoy a guided painting experience in a relaxed\, creative atmosphere while sipping award-winning sparkling wines. Seasonal bites\, thoughtfully curated by the Estate Chef\, complement the experience\, creating a perfect blend of art\, flavor\, and celebration.    Whether attending with family or friends\, this unique event offers a memorable way to connect\, create\, and unwind. Surrounded by vineyard views\, guests can embrace the moment and make lasting memories in a beautiful wine country setting.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/the-sparkling-soiree-at-gloria-ferrer-winery/
