SUMMARY:Build-Your-Own Bouquet Bar at Montgomery Village
DESCRIPTION:Build-Your-Own Bouquet Bar at Made Local Marketplace\, Montgomery Village invites guests to celebrate Mother’s Day weekend with a creative floral experience in a relaxed\, drop-in setting.    Held at Made Local Marketplace\, this event features fresh\, seasonal blooms from Sage B Willow Farm\, allowing guests to design their own custom bouquet. Whether creating a thoughtful gift for Mom or enjoying a personal creative moment\, this experience is designed to be both simple and inspiring. Light guidance is available throughout\, making it accessible for all skill levels.    Choose from a curated selection of flowers and complete your arrangement with elegant wrapping materials. Guests may drop in at any time during the event window. No ticket is required\, though advance registration is recommended. Bouquets are available while supplies last.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/build-your-own-bouquet-bar-at-montgomery-village/
