SUMMARY:Mother's Day Floral Workshop at Imagery Estate Winery
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Mother’s Day at Imagery Estate Winery with a hands-on floral arranging workshop led by botanical artist Chloë Noggle. This creative experience invites guests to design a beautiful\, spring-inspired arrangement\, perfect as a heartfelt gift or stunning centerpiece.    Designed for moms and their loved ones\, the workshop offers a relaxed and inspiring setting to connect\, create\, and enjoy the beauty of seasonal blooms. All materials are provided\, with tools available on-site for convenience.    This engaging and memorable event is a wonderful way to celebrate Mother’s Day through creativity\, connection\, and wine country charm.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/mothers-day-floral-workshop-at-imagery-estate-winery/
